  "title": {
    "rendered": "ስልጠና"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">*///*<br />\nለዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህጻናት ማሳደጊያ እስታፍ የቢሮ ሰራተኞች መጀመሪያ ደረጃ እርዳታ(First Aid) አሰጣል ስልጠና በብሉ እልዝ ካምፓኒ(blue health company) በድርጅቱ ቅጥር ግቢ ውስጥ ታህሳስ 15/2014 ዓ.ም ተሰጠ<br />\nስልጠናው ህጻናቱ በግቢ ውስጥ ድንገት ሲታመሙ ወደ ህክምና ተቋማት እስኪደርሱ ድረስ መሰጠት ስላለበት እርዳታ ግንዛቤ እንዲያገኙ ተደርጓል።</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-838\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-300x200.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-768x511.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-24x16.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-36x24.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19-48x32.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-19.jpg 832w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-839\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-300x200.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-768x511.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-24x16.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-36x24.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25-48x32.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/photo_2021-12-28_16-18-25.jpg 832w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>*///* ለዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህጻናት ማሳደጊያ እስታፍ የቢሮ ሰራተኞች መጀመሪያ ደረጃ እርዳታ(First Aid) አሰጣል ስልጠና በብሉ እልዝ ካምፓኒ(blue health company) በድርጅቱ ቅጥር ግቢ ውስጥ ታህሳስ 15/2014 ዓ.ም ተሰጠ ስልጠናው ህጻናቱ በግቢ ውስጥ ድንገት ሲታመሙ ወደ ህክምና ተቋማት እስኪደርሱ ድረስ መሰጠት ስላለበት እርዳታ ግንዛቤ እንዲያገኙ ተደርጓል።</p>\n",
